likely to die and end up in a bones file.  I sometimes shuttle items to
my main stash in the bag but then I'm crossing explored and cleared
territory much less likely to die in combat.  Thinking now about the
times I've died int he mid-game and later - More often to a typo than in
combat so maybe 50-50 the bag has my backup ascension kit items and
50-50 the bag has my loot headed towards my main stash.


